            "review_title": "Review at Ham Ruou Ban Me (Ban Me Cellars)",
            "review_text": "DZOO\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam22 contributions\n0\nPleasant dinner. ..\nFeb 2017 • Friends\nWe visited this Restaurant on Feb. 23rd, 2017. Actually they have not any wine cellar yet, but it's OK with the decoration of mural shelves containing wine bottles on the 1st floor, trying giving you impression of wine cellar.\nVery nice staff, and we would recommend their excellent pork (from pigs raised by local ethnic minorities).\nWe do hope next time we can see your wine cellars, dear Ham Ruou Ban Me !\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 28, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
