            "review_title": "Review at Ham Ruou Ban Me (Ban Me Cellars)",
            "review_text": "Duc T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nBest place in town for local foods and wine\nJan 2017 • Family\nI guess there might be a better local foods restaurant out there but this is the only place that serves local foods with some decent table wines. \n\nThe decoration is great for both family gathering and couple romance. If you are on the rooftop after the sunset, you can enjoy your foods and wine in the cool weather of the highland. This is the most interesting thing that I enjoyed each time I get here. \n\nThis is also one of the very few standalone restaurants (not attached to hotels) that accept credit cards and have good table service.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
