            "review_text": "WPS_13\nBuon Ma Thuot, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nPleasant evening at Ham Ruou Ban Me\nJan 2016 • Family\nWe were risking to celebrate my wife's birthday without prior knowledge of the restaurant Ham Ruou Ban Me (Ban Me Cellars). We were pleasantly surprised. Finally a place where there was discreet background music and no noise roar. The food was good, though lacking the final refinement. The wine selection is limited, and there is obviously no wine fridge. The wine was cooled after the order (red). No choice of desserts. Prices were reasonable. All in all, we are happy to recommend the restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 5, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
